## Better: break the template into components

Invoices tend to grow. I'd split them up.

```
invoice.typ.j2
partials/
    header.typ.j2
    customer.typ.j2
    lines.typ.j2
    totals.typ.j2
    footer.typ.j2
```

The main template becomes

```jinja
#import "styles.typ": *

{% include "partials/header.typ.j2" %}

{% include "partials/customer.typ.j2" %}

{% include "partials/lines.typ.j2" %}

{% include "partials/totals.typ.j2" %}

{% include "partials/footer.typ.j2" %}
```

Each partial remains mostly Typst.

