## Conditional sections

MiniJinja works nicely for optional fields.

```jinja
{% if invoice.status == "Paid" %}

#box(
    fill: green.lighten(80%),
    inset: 8pt,
)[
    *PAID*
]

{% endif %}
```

or

```jinja
{% if line.tax_category_id %}
    [GST]
{% else %}
    [-]
{% endif %}
```

