## Custom filters

Rather than littering the template with formatting logic, I'd define filters in Rust and keep the template clean:

```jinja
{{ invoice.issue_date | date }}
{{ line.unit_price | money }}
{{ invoice.total_amount | money }}
{{ line.quantity | qty }}
```

That makes the template much more readable.

